# All sports locked except the one unlocked

**Before any site work:** lock every sport and every results card. Unlock only
the sport the owner named.

**Triple lock (2026-09-16):** also follow `.cursor/rules/triple-lock-sports.mdc`.
Fixing player props is **not** an unlock for any sport’s picks/results pages.
Unlocked work must not touch locked sports’ card faces.

All locked by default (picks + results): MLB, NHL, NBA, NFL, NCAAF, NCAAB,
NCAAW, WNBA, CFL, soccer, tennis, UFC, golf. No agent edits to any of those
surfaces without **UNLOCK &lt;SPORT&gt;** naming the miss.

Requires **UNLOCK &lt;SPORT&gt;** plus the miss. One sport. One miss.

A hang, timeout, cloaking fix, checker, chrome pass, or blank-slate restore
for sport A is **not** an unlock for sport B. Do not touch `NHL77FINAL.py` /
`team_results_charts.py` / `mlb_*` for sport B while sport A is the unlock.

**Extra layers (2026-09-16):** also follow `.cursor/rules/sport-lock-enforcement.mdc`.
Shared `_merge_stored_upcoming_predictions` allow-list changes are blank-slate
only — never an excuse to rewrite another sport’s Books / face / model chips.

```
# BAD — owner unlocked nothing; agent edits NHL77FINAL.py for soccer while MLB is locked
# BAD — owner said UNLOCK MLB Books; agent also patches CFL/soccer
# BAD — NCAAF blank emergency; agent also changes NFL card face without UNLOCK NFL
# GOOD — UNLOCK MLB + Books/H2H on that card; leave every other sport alone
```

See AGENTS.md Rule 12.
